    "review": [
      "All ui/fx scenes inspected. Existing scene paths retained; animated sprites and GPU particles remain native Godot nodes.",
      "Player restoration uses gold extracted illustration, 24 particles; card trails use small gold motes with original fade.",
      "Treasure confetti replaced with gold illustrated motes: 4 x 12, 1.2 second lifetime.",
      "Enemy death has flash and dust only; Obelisk adds its existing brief shatter. Summoning uses plum motes after authoritative placement.",
      "Phase echo retains actual unit silhouette in muted cyan, short fade; tile collapse retains authored AnimationPlayer sequence and tile texture.",
      "Damage/block text retains shared outlined FeedbackText. Gathering uses crystal icon and gold shared text, removing neon green/comic font.",
      "Target/telegraph shader retains actual hex geometry and bounded alpha; white hit flash retains node modulation.",
      "Fog, card burn, battle intro/outro vignette and selection outlines retained for their specialized function. No new global postprocessing.",
      "Ambient stars in map/menu/pause retained as small subdued teal/plum shapes; they remain secondary to illustrated environments.",
      "All HUD/map/status/action icons inspected as one ivory outline family. Resource cube replaced by terrain crystal cluster; health/clock normalized.",
      "Replaced old HDR stock enemy-selection glyph with a reference-guided hand-illustrated cyan energy marker; rejected geometric SVG removed across all three enemy scene templates."
    ],
